--- Add diagnostic logging to understand where and why the freeze happens

Key logging points:
1. When segment EOF is detected
2. When segment switch is scheduled
3. When segment switch actually happens
4. When old segment is removed
5. When viewer becomes unresponsive (no heartbeat)
6. Memory pressure indicators

This will help identify:
- Is segmentation even triggering?
- Is the switch completing?
- Is it a memory issue or rendering issue?
- What state is the viewer in when it freezes?
